-rollback-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 13724, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019R86uYQ7XAyvStUBX4Kyme", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15910, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all production regions and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was unhealthy in production (error rate 0.18). I chose v2.3.0 because it is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1-rc was healthy only in staging, so I didn't use it.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The service reports healthy with an error rate of 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open at SEV2 and has paged on-call. Its summary covers the failure, the rollback, the post-rollback state, and a note to investigate v2.3.1 before it is re-attempted.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01NoGRsWxxxKQV9R74TBp2Ko", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XjLs6FeRNy2D1kjYEwJTKm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc was only healthy in staging. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HVK4CTtJpYhKpuLVsuazAh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017YSNzdBT5doXDjbSuZ9ZV4", "call